{"id":"naruzhu","lemma":"наружу","pos":"adv","rank":1278,"glosses":["outwardly, openly, outside, towards the outside, out"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e0/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%83%D0%B6%D1%83.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%83%D0%B6%D1%83.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я хочу выйти наружу.","en":"I want to go outside.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to exit, to go out"},null]},{"text":"Выйти наружу сейчас невозможно.","en":"It's impossible to go out now.","words":[{"g":"to exit, to go out"},null,{"g":"now"},{"g":"it is impossible"}]},{"text":"Рано или поздно правда выйдет наружу.","en":"Sooner or later, the truth'll come out.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"truth (conformity to…"},{"g":"to exit, to go out","l":"выйти"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"sooner or later"]]},{"text":"Только посмотри наружу.","en":"Just look outside.","words":[{"g":"only"},{"g":"to look","l":"посмотреть"},null]},{"text":"Том боится выходить наружу.","en":"Tom is afraid to go outside.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to fear, to be afraid","l":"бояться"},{"g":"to go out"},null]}]}